description:
Thermal Break Aluminum Windows and Doors for New Construction - Life Time Warranty - CozyHome Mississauga

• Over 20 years in making windows and doors;
• Thermal break frame system creates an insulated barrier to significantly minimize the transfer of heat and cold;
• 2 or 3 Layers of fully tempered safety glass with Low-E (emissivity) coating and filled with argon in between;
• Powder coating finished frame with a large variety of AkzoNobel color options and custom colors available;
• Glass thickness is available in 6mm, 8mm, 10mm, and 12mm, and custom thickness is available;
• Bulletproof glass is available;
• Every customer receives our fully written factory lifetime warranty after the completion of their installation;
• Window options:
o Casement window
o Tilt and turn window
o Awning window
o Bay and bow window
o Folding window
o Sliding window
o Single or Double Hung
o Specialty window
• Door options:
o Aluminum patio doors:
 Swing door
 Sliding door
 Folding door
 Pivot…
